#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:2 306dd14eb09f44df8d7e1900679c5e7e
msgid "Detailed response types"
msgstr "详细响应类型"

#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:5 b93cc018209c44e988fde98a6e5b6336
msgid "Info responses"
msgstr "Info 响应"

#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:7 e7eeea43fbb04901b118b271b8d99c3f
msgid ""
"Info response objects are ``TypedDict`` classes and type aliases "
"preserving Hyperliquid's wire field names. Numeric wire fields remain "
"strings."
msgstr ""
"Info 响应对象是保留 Hyperliquid wire 字段名称的 ``TypedDict`` 类和类型别名。"
"数值 wire 字段仍为字符串。"

#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:15 ca555036e9d943a990c57daa1547066a
msgid "Exchange response envelopes"
msgstr "Exchange 响应封装"

#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:17 7a5ca19cac584ae5864a28bc305ec638
msgid ""
"Every Exchange response has a top-level ``status``. Successful order, "
"cancel, and TWAP responses contain operation-specific data; a default "
"success contains only the default acknowledgement. A protocol rejection "
"is an ``ExchangeError`` with ``status == \"err\"`` and a string "
"``response``."
msgstr ""
"每个 Exchange 响应都有顶层 ``status``。成功的订单、取消和 TWAP 响应包含特定于操作的数据；"
"默认成功响应仅包含默认确认。协议拒绝是 ``ExchangeError``，其 ``status == \"err\"``，"
"且 ``response`` 为字符串。"

#: ../../reference/response-types.rst:22 84d47dcd02d541a18de2f3d23aa4e267
msgid ""
"The public aliases :data:`async_hyperliquid.types.PlaceOrderResponse`, "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.CancelOrderResponse`, "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.PlaceTwapResponse`, "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.CancelTwapResponse`, "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.DefaultActionResponse`, and "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.ActionResponse` compose the detailed "
"shapes below."
msgstr ""
"公共别名 :data:`async_hyperliquid.types.PlaceOrderResponse`、"
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.CancelOrderResponse`、"
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.PlaceTwapResponse`、"
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.CancelTwapResponse`、"
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.DefaultActionResponse` 和 "
":data:`async_hyperliquid.types.ActionResponse` 组成以下详细结构。"
